error[E0070]: the type parameter `B` of the alias `Pair` is not used
 --> tests/ui/03-types/aliases/alias_unused_parameter.cheby:5:18
  |
5 | pub type Pair<A, B> = (A, A)
  |                  ^ not used in the definition
  |
  = note: an alias is replaced by its definition, so an unused parameter would make different-looking types the same (§4.4)
  = help: use `B` in the definition, or remove it

